-
-/-- **Minkowski's second theorem, the upper bound** (Cassels, Chapter VIII, Theorem V, the
-inequality (12) of VIII.1): `(∏ i < n, λ i) * volume B ≤ 2 ^ n * covolume L`. This is the
-substantial half, the one Layer 5 and 6.3 consume.
